            "contentId": "ch2_4049",
            "content": {
                "en": "Lately, I keep wondering...",
                "zh": "“最近我总是在想，",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": -690.0,
            "positionY": 394.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 0
        },
        {
            "id": "c0d679bd-91df-425c-a8a9-12c57d6a333e",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4050",
            "content": {
                "en": "if I hadn’t continued down this path,",
                "zh": "如果没有继续走上这条路，",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": -226.0,
            "positionY": 365.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 0
        },
        {
            "id": "741441da-e355-4c47-8bfc-6adc93edc8e9",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4051",
            "content": {
                "en": "would life have been a little easier?",
                "zh": "会不会活得更轻松一点。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 136.0,
            "positionY": 364.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 0
        },
        {
            "id": "f4e67c9f-e0bf-4978-997e-a2153e19d11e",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4052",
            "content": {
                "en": "It feels like this path was chosen for me",
                "zh": "好像从出生开始，",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 481.0,
            "positionY": 364.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 0
        },
        {
            "id": "e18af938-89de-4234-a383-d7de6dcb8212",
            "index": 6,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4053",
            "content": {
                "en": "from the moment I was born.",
                "zh": "这条路就已经替我定好了。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 831.0,
            "positionY": 364.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 0
        },
        {
            "id": "26c56866-3a7b-483d-adcc-f9fd11bc4e16",
            "index": 7,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4054",
            "content": {
                "en": "I’ve done what they wanted,",
                "zh": "我照着他们的意思去做，",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1182.0,
            "positionY": 363.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 0
        },
        {
            "id": "185893a6-e22c-4fcb-9525-78acb482b1c8",
            "index": 8,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4055",
            "content": {
                "en": "step by step, without asking questions.",
                "zh": "一步一步，不去追问。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1526.0,
            "positionY": 373.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 0
        },
        {
            "id": "1ec3ef49-2f6c-49f5-bb46-aef73488a386",
            "index": 9,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4056",
            "content": {
                "en": "But the more I do that,",
                "zh": "可越是这样，我越忍不住怀疑。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1867.0,
            "positionY": 373.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 0
        },
        {
            "id": "596e8421-b2b9-4ca2-a607-690f6578b7bd",
            "index": 10,
            "characterId": "8bf512c1-230a-4da9-a433-47d205ee6363",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch2_4057",
            "content": {
                "en": "the more I can’t stop myself from doubting.",
                "zh": "这真的是我想要的吗？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2238.0,
            "positionY": 373.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": [],
            "textAlignment": 0
        },
        {
